CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785671293
OL,3,CFuneral director jailed over bodies
OL,4,Cand ashes 'horror'
OL,6,FA funeral director who hoarded bodies
OL,7,Fand gave grieving relatives the wrong
OL,8,Fashes has been jailed for 20 years.
OL,10,FA court heard how Robert Bush, who ran
OL,11,FLegacy Independent Funeral Directors
OL,12,Fin Hull, failed to carry out promised
OL,13,Fcremations and handed people remains
OL,14,Fthat did not belong to their loved
OL,15,Fones "with a smile on his face".
OL,17,FThirty-five bodies in varying states
OL,18,Fof decomposition and half a tonne of
OL,19,Fashes were found at his premises on
OL,20,FHessle Road following a report to
OL,21,Fpolice in March 2024.
OL,26,@wD@FOUwD@_O]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/13
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785671293
OL,3,CFuneral director jailed over bodies
OL,4,Cand ashes 'horror'
OL,6,FBush had also sold fraudulent funeral
OL,7,Fplans and pocketed charitable
OL,8,Fdonations given in memory of the
OL,9,Fdeceased.
OL,11,FHull Crown Court heard he had breached
OL,12,Fthe trust of bereaved families "on an
OL,13,Falmost industrial scale".
OL,15,FSentencing Bush for 67 offences,
OL,16,Fincluding preventing a lawful and
OL,17,Fdecent burial and fraud, the judge Mr
OL,18,FJustice Hilliard KC said on Friday: "I
OL,19,Fdo not think I have ever known
OL,20,Foffences affect so many people and so
OL,21,Fmany people so deeply."
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/13
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785671293
OL,3,CFuneral director jailed over bodies
OL,4,Cand ashes 'horror'
OL,6,FBush, 48, showed no reaction as he was
OL,7,Fsentenced.
OL,9,FMr Justice Hilliard KC said he was "so
OL,10,Fpre-occupied with his own enrichment
OL,11,Fthat he behaved in a shocking and
OL,12,Fdisgraceful way towards the deceased
OL,13,Fentrusted to his care, and his
OL,14,Fbehaviour towards their living
OL,15,Frelatives was characterised by
OL,16,Fdishonesty, deception and
OL,17,Fheartlessness".
OL,26,@qD@dOUyD@NO]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/13
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785671293
OL,3,CFuneral director jailed over bodies
OL,4,Cand ashes 'horror'
OL,6,FThe two-and-a-half year Legacy
OL,7,Finvestigation began after Bush asked
OL,8,Ftwo fellow funeral directors to help
OL,9,Fwith the retrieval of a body while he
OL,10,Fwas on holiday in Arizona.
OL,12,FThey became suspicious after comments
OL,13,Ffrom a casual worker employed by Bush
OL,14,Fabout conditions inside the home,
OL,15,Fwhich were described as a "horror
OL,16,Fscene".
OL,18,FAfter gaining access to Legacy, the
OL,19,Fpair were "shocked" by what they found
OL,20,Fand immediately flagged down a passing
OL,21,Fpolice car.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G4/13
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785671293
OL,3,CFuneral director jailed over bodies
OL,4,Cand ashes 'horror'
OL,6,FInvestigators discovered human ashes
OL,7,Fstored "chaotically", boxes of which
OL,8,Fhad begun growing mould due to the
OL,9,Fstate of the building, and items
OL,10,Fbelonging to the deceased strewn about
OL,11,Fhaphazardly.
OL,13,FAmong the bodies were the remains of a
OL,14,Fbaby.
OL,16,FThe court heard many families had
OL,17,Fashes made into jewellery or interred
OL,18,Fwith other loved ones.
OL,26,@oD@HOUoD@TO]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G5/13
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785671293
OL,3,CFuneral director jailed over bodies
OL,4,Cand ashes 'horror'
OL,6,FRea Burton, who used her grandfather's
OL,7,Fashes for jewellery, said: "Robert
OL,8,FBush deceived us. He had abandoned and
OL,9,Fhidden our loved one for months and
OL,10,Fhanded us a stranger's ashes with a
OL,11,Fsmile on his face."
OL,13,FBush was also sentenced for selling
OL,14,Ffraudulent funeral plans to 226 people
OL,15,Ftotalling over half a million pounds,
OL,16,Fand the theft of charity collections
OL,17,Fintended for 12 organisations.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G6/13
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785671293
OL,3,CFuneral director jailed over bodies
OL,4,Cand ashes 'horror'
OL,6,FBush was ultimately charged with 30
OL,7,Fcounts of preventing a lawful and
OL,8,Fdecent burial and 30 of fraud for each
OL,9,Fof those people, for whom he lied to
OL,10,Ffamilies claiming cremations had taken
OL,11,Fplace, as well as four further counts
OL,12,Fof fraud for giving away the wrong
OL,13,Fashes for unborn babies.
OL,15,FRichard Wright KC, for Bush, said his
OL,16,Fcrimes were likely due to a
OL,17,Fcombination of "greed",
OL,18,F"incompetence", "the passage of time"
OL,19,Fand "inability to keep up with
OL,20,Ffailings".
OL,26,@yD@POUyD@VO]zD@AOUzD@NO]zD@QOUzD@eO]{D@
OL,26,AEOU|D@IO]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G7/13
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33408
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785671293
OL,3,CFuneral director jailed over bodies
OL,4,Cand ashes 'horror'
OL,6,FThe judge said Bush wrongly blamed
OL,7,Fcashflow problems for his offending.
OL,9,FHe said: "I reject that entirely
OL,10,Fwithout hesitation. The only problem
OL,11,Fwas the direction in which the cash
OL,12,Fwas flowing."
OL,14,FHe added: "We now know that Mr Bush
OL,15,Ftook any and every opportunity that
OL,16,Fpresented itself in the course of his
OL,17,Fwork dishonestly to enrich himself at
OL,18,Fthe expense of those who used his
OL,19,Fservices and at great cost to the
OL,20,Fdignity of some and the peace of mind
OL,21,Fof others."
OL,26,@qD@JOUtD@MO]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G8/13
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33409
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785671293
OL,3,CFuneral director jailed over bodies
OL,4,Cand ashes 'horror'
OL,6,FSpeaking after the sentencing, Louise
OL,7,FPetrow, who was given the wrong ashes
OL,8,Fafter losing her mother-in-law Lynne
OL,9,FDenise-Wheel at the age of 54, said
OL,10,Fthe sentence was not enough.
OL,12,F"What he did to those people, he
OL,13,Fshould get life," she said.
OL,15,FThe investigation into Legacy was the
OL,16,Fbiggest in the history of Humberside
OL,17,FPolice.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G9/13
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33410
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785671293
OL,3,CFuneral director jailed over bodies
OL,4,Cand ashes 'horror'
OL,6,FSenior investigator Det Supt Alan
OL,7,FCurtis said: "Behind every enquiry,
OL,8,Fevery statement and every piece of
OL,9,Fevidence, were people who had lost a
OL,10,Floved one and placed their trust in a
OL,11,Ffuneral director to care for them with
OL,12,Fdignity.
OL,14,F"The distress that this investigation
OL,15,Fhas caused for those families is
OL,16,Fsimply unimaginable, and even after
OL,17,Fworking on this case rigorously over
OL,18,Fthe last couple of years, the sheer
OL,19,Fimpact this has had on our whole
OL,20,Fcommunity, and further afield, remains
OL,21,Fincomprehensible."
OL,26,@oD@NOUvD@AOU
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1        G10/13
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33411
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785671293
OL,3,CFuneral director jailed over bodies
OL,4,Cand ashes 'horror'
OL,6,FLaura Tams, deputy chief crown
OL,7,Fprosecutor for the Crown Prosecution
OL,8,FService, said Bush's crimes "represent
OL,9,Fsome of the most serious breaches of
OL,10,Ftrust possible in the funeral
OL,11,Findustry".
OL,13,FShe added: "The impact on the families
OL,14,Fand wider community has been profound.
OL,15,FAt their most vulnerable time, when
OL,16,Fseeking dignity and closure for their
OL,17,Floved ones, these families were
OL,18,Fsubjected to appalling violations of
OL,19,Ftrust.
OL,26,@uD@LOU
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1        G11/13
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33412
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785671293
OL,3,CFuneral director jailed over bodies
OL,4,Cand ashes 'horror'
OL,6,FThe case has furthered calls for
OL,7,Fstronger regulation of the funeral
OL,8,Findustry.
OL,10,FSpeaking on a visit to Sheffield on
OL,11,FFriday, the Prime Minister backed
OL,12,Fthose calls.
OL,14,FAndy Burnham said: "I was truly
OL,15,Fhorrified when I heard what had
OL,16,Fhappened. (It's) appalling for any
OL,17,Ffamily to go through that. This needs
OL,18,Fa proper response in terms of the
OL,19,Fregulation needed, to make sure no
OL,20,Ffamily goes through that again.
OL,26,@vD@TOUxD@KpmxD@Ppn
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1        G12/13
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33413
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785671293
OL,3,CFuneral director jailed over bodies
OL,4,Cand ashes 'horror'
OL,6,F"People, I think, would assume that
OL,7,Fthe highest standards apply to this
OL,8,Farea and we've got to make sure that
OL,9,Fthey do apply and that there can't be
OL,10,Fany repeat of what we've seen."
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@_O]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1        G13/13
